    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Built from the official show notes and transcript. Minted 5 concepts (ClimateSensitivity, AerosolMasking, ZeroEmissionsCommitment, EarthEnergyImbalance, ClimateAsANormalProblem), 4 Works, and Relationship.NateHagens_ZekeHausfather, resolving the last unresolved IRI in the graph. Back-links on all 12 references. Corrected Human.ZekeHausfather's comment: Berkeley Earth is one of 14 independent groups producing global temperature records (per the transcript), not 'one of five', and the 2027 projection is about 1.8°C on air but 1.71°C in the show notes' fact-check."@en ;
    .

