    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-18"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the modeled-only entry (first step of the Schmachtenberger enrichment). Minted 7 concepts (ThreeCirclesOfAIEnvironmentalImpact, BindingTheJevonsParadox, InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure, MaximizingReturnsOnPower, OmniLose, PrecautionaryPrinciple, CorrelationOfForceAndMeans), 3 Works (TacklingClimateChangeWithMachineLearning, DevelopmentInProgress, WhereArgumentsComeFrom) and Organization.CivilizationResearchInstitute. Added dct:isPartOf from ConsilienceProject to the Institute (previously stated only in its definition), skos:altLabel 'Moloch' on MultipolarTrap (linked in this episode's show notes), the missing back-links from TGS_126 and to TGS_184 (which already referenced this episode), and the reference to TGS_71 confirmed by the show notes. First use of dct:publisher on a Work."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGS_71_FullBuild a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
