    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-18"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the 2026-09-12 stub (second step of the Schmachtenberger enrichment). Minted 8 concepts (ThirdAttractor, IntelligenceBoundByWisdom, NarrowGoalAchieving, NaiveProgress, TechnologyIsNotValuesNeutral, AIAsMetacrisisAccelerant, OpportunityRiskAsymmetry, RiskSingularity) and Work.TechnologyIsNotValuesNeutral. Back-links on all 11 references. Also added dct:references from TGS_126 to this episode and corrected the stale IRI in TGS_126's scopeNote (tgs:Interview.TGS_71_ArtificialIntelligenceAndTheSuperorganism, which never existed), and added discusses NaiveProgress to TGS_126."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGS_50_FullBuild a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
