    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the modeled-only entry (third step of the Schmachtenberger enrichment). Minted 5 concepts (ThreeByThreeResponseGrid, HolisticExternalityAnalysis, EcologyOfTheoriesOfChange, HighTouchGrounding, EmbeddedGrowthObligation) and Work.TheOverspentAmerican. Back-links on all 8 references. Updated tgs:Concept.InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure's scopeNote with the origin Daniel gives here (Marvin Harris's cultural materialism, drawing on Marx), correcting the TGS_132 note that he names no origin, and added to tgs:Concept.PredicamentNotProblem's scopeNote Daniel's citation of Richard Haass."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGS_42_FullBuild a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
