    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the modeled-only entry (fourth step of the Schmachtenberger enrichment). Minted 6 concepts (RecursiveAbstraction, PositiveSumInGroupNegativeSumToNature, LocalizedSyntropySystemicEntropy, GlobalGovernanceWithoutGlobalGovernment, GameTheoreticVersusRealValue, IAmBecauseWeAre) and Work.Nonzero. Back-links on all 10 references. Corrected the claim that TGS_71 is where Daniel first names the third attractor (tgs:Concept.ThirdAttractor scopeNote; TGS_71 definition and scopeNote): he names it here, at about 1:18. Updated tgs:Concept.ThreeByThreeResponseGrid (Part 4 now built; the third axis of hyper-agents, egregores and institutions), tgs:Concept.EmbeddedGrowthObligation (compounding interest as the financial system's 'own physics') and tgs:Concept.InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure (Daniel's use of it here for group selection)."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGS_31_FullBuild a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
