    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the modeled-only entry (fifth step of the Schmachtenberger enrichment; kept the existing rdfs:comment and YouTube replay). Minted 7 concepts (OneMarshmallowRewardCircuits, PrematureCertainty, SensemakingPrerequisiteOfOpenSociety, FragmentedConsciousness, DiscretePhaseShift, PostTragic, HeartWillMind) and Work.DietForANewAmerica. Back-links on all 8 references. Pointed tgs:Concept.IntelligenceBoundByWisdom and the TGS_50 scopeNote to the new tgs:Concept.FragmentedConsciousness, and noted on tgs:Concept.InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure that Part 3 previews the framework."@en ;
    .

