    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the modeled-only entry (sixth step of the Schmachtenberger enrichment; kept the existing YouTube replay). Minted 7 concepts (HyperAgents, MoneyAsMaximumOptionality, GeneralizedJevonsParadox, AtomsEnergyBits, AxiologicalDesign, TheLastCanToKick, ImpossibleToHard); no new works. Back-links on all 6 references. Recorded TGS_20 as the earliest TGS source for ideas previously minted from later episodes: tgs:Concept.MultipolarTrap (Daniel's full construction), tgs:Concept.OpportunityRiskAsymmetry, tgs:Concept.TechnologyIsNotValuesNeutral (the plow story), tgs:Concept.MaximizingReturnsOnPower ('returns on agency'), tgs:Concept.HeartWillMind (head, heart, will), tgs:Concept.ThreeByThreeResponseGrid (Nate's horizons), tgs:Concept.InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure (resolving 'Part 2 or 4'), and tgs:Concept.EmbeddedGrowthObligation; added a scopeNote to tgs:Concept.MaximumPowerPrinciple."@en ;
    .

