    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the modeled-only entry (seventh and last step of the Bend Not Break enrichment; kept the existing rdfs:comment). Minted 6 concepts (ExosomaticEnergy, CostOfExtractionPricing, TwoCategoriesOfTechnology, JevonsDividend, AdvancePolicy, Untax); no new works. Back-links on all 5 references. Recorded TGS_5 as the earliest source on tgs:Concept.InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure (Nate introduces Marvin Harris), tgs:Concept.MaximumPowerPrinciple (Nate explains it to Daniel) and tgs:Concept.EmbeddedGrowthObligation. Updated tgs:Relationship.NateHagens_DanielSchmachtenberger: added the missing TGS_71 appearance, filled publication dates for TGS_5, TGS_50, TGS_126 and TGS_132, and replaced the scopeNote's count with the verified set of eight TGS interviews plus the RR_10 panel."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.SchmachtenbergerLensEnrichment a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Concept.TragedyOfTheCommons, tgs:Concept.MultipolarTrap, tgs:Concept.Untax, tgs:Concept.InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-18"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Schema and content enrichment after the Bend Not Break builds. Added thinkr:hasAnalyticalLens (tgs-core) with the enumeration thinkr:AnalyticalLensType (GameTheoretic, Biophysical, PsychologicalInner, Institutional, PracticalPersonal; enumerations.ttl), and tagged 72 concepts -- those discussed in Daniel Schmachtenberger's episodes plus the Nate concepts they bridge to. Added thinkr:complements (symmetric sub-property of thinkr:relatesTo) and eight Schmachtenberger-Hagens bridges, each with a LinkNote and a Candidate Evidence awaiting review (calculatedConfidence to be derived by scripts/compute_confidence.py). Minted tgs:Concept.TragedyOfTheCommons and tgs:Work.TragedyOfTheCommons1968 (MJSullivan's observation on Untax), linked from MultipolarTrap, Untax, TGS_20 and TGS_50. Credited tgs:Persona.MarvinHarris on InfrastructureSocialStructureSuperstructure, correcting 'not built' notes on TGS_5 and TGS_50. Added thinkr:hasHostIntroduction to TGS_5, 20, 31, 42, 50, 71 and 132 (generic show teaser removed, as elsewhere)."@en ;
    .

