    thinkr:revisionNote "Rebuilt from the complete transcript and show notes supplied by MJSullivan, superseding the 2026-08-13 build (its chronology findings kept in the scopeNote). Minted 8 concepts (AuthenticProgress, ProgressNarrativeAsApologism, RestraintByDesign, YellowTeaming, PowerSeekingAndComplicity, CorporationAsObligateSociopath, GameTheoryFillsTheOughtGap, ProblemSolvingAsRacket) and 5 works (SilentSpring, WarIsARacket, TheoryOfGamesAndEconomicBehavior, HowToMisleadWithFacts, HospicingModernity). Replaced dct:references to a Persona and a Human with works and episodes; back-links on all 14 references. Expanded discusses from 3 to 30 concepts. Added scopeNotes from TGS_126 to NaiveProgress, HyperAgents, IAmBecauseWeAre, TechnologyIsNotValuesNeutral, RecursiveAbstraction, TragedyOfTheCommons, FragmentedConsciousness and PrecautionaryPrinciple; lens tags on the new concepts; and two new thinkr:complements bridges with LinkNotes (RestraintByDesign-JevonsDividend, CorporationAsObligateSociopath-CorporationsAsMisalignedAI)."@en ;
    .

