    thinkr:affects tgs:Monologue.Frankly_78_ABriefClarificationOnHumanBehavior ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from the official transcript and show notes, replacing the 2026-09-12 stub. Minted tgs:Concept.ThreeTimelinesOfResponse and tgs:Concept.ProsocialityUnderTheSuperorganism, with lens tags and thinkr:complements bridges from tgs:Concept.ThreeByThreeResponseGrid and tgs:Concept.GameTheoryFillsTheOughtGap. Note added to tgs:Concept.DarkTriad. Back-links on both references."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGSGlossary_GapPass a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Work.TGSGlossary ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Gap pass against @DoutorSabonetes's TGS Glossary (minted as tgs:Work.TGSGlossary). Minted tgs:Concept.WideBoundary, tgs:Concept.WileECoyoteMoment, tgs:Concept.MusicalChairsMoment, tgs:Concept.OvertonWindow and tgs:Concept.DissipativeStructures, with definitions drawn from Nate's own built episodes and lens tags, and a thinkr:complements bridge from tgs:Concept.HolisticExternalityAnalysis to tgs:Concept.WideBoundary. Added skos:altLabel values from the glossary: 'Human labour equivalents' (tgs:Concept.EnergySlaves), 'Moloch trap' (tgs:Concept.MultipolarTrap), 'Financial claims on biophysical reality' (tgs:Concept.MoneyAsClaimOnEnergy), 'Ecological overshoot' (tgs:Concept.Overshoot). Loss aversion is queued until Frankly_25 is built."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.Frankly_25_FullBuild a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Monologue.Frankly_25_LossAversion ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Full build from MJSullivan's transcript and the episode page's show notes, replacing the 2026-09-12 stub; replay ID from the episode page. Minted tgs:Concept.LossAversion, the last gap queued from the TGS Glossary pass, with a PsychologicalInner lens tag. Earliest-source note on tgs:Concept.RichInSocialCapital. Back-link on its 1 reference."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.ShortDefinitions_2026_10_19 a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Replaced skos:definition on the 81 concepts discussed in three or more episodes with short, plain-language, glossary-style definitions, reviewed by MJSullivan and first exported as the TGS glossary for the Hylo community. Added thinkr:extendedDefinition (an annotation property, subproperty of skos:note) and moved the earlier long definition there for 64 concepts where it carried detail the short one does not; for 16 the old definition was a near-duplicate and was dropped (CrudeOil, EnergySlaves, CarbonPulse, EnergyBlindness, GrowthImperative, GreatSimplification, DiscountRatesAndPresentBias, TheoryOfChange, Metacrisis, Wetware, JevonsParadox, Superorganism, ComplexityCollapse, MoneyAsClaimOnEnergy, BiophysicalGauntlet, LimitsToGrowth). tgs:Concept.MoreThanHumanPredicament, which had no definition, received one; its open question about overlap with tgs:Concept.HumanPredicament remains. tgs:Concept.FiveHorsemenOf2020s and tgs:Concept.FourHorsemenOfThe2020s share one merged definition pending a decision to merge them."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.HorsemenMerge_2026_10_19 a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Concept.FourHorsemenOfThe2020s, tgs:Concept.FiveHorsemenOf2020s ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Merged the duplicate tgs:Concept.FiveHorsemenOf2020s into tgs:Concept.FourHorsemenOfThe2020s at MJSullivan's direction, after he confirmed they are one concept counted two ways. 'Five Horsemen of the 2020s' became an exact-match thinkr:AlternateTerm and 'The Four Horsemen' a skos:altLabel; the extended definition, scope note and subject were carried over; all episode thinkr:discusses links and prose IRIs in concepts and episodes were repointed; lens tags added. The old IRI is kept as an owl:deprecated stub with dcterms:isReplacedBy, untyped, so it still resolves. Earlier revision notes that name the old IRI are left as historical record."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.FourHorsemenOfTheApocalypse_Minted a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Concept.FourHorsemenOfTheApocalypse, tgs:Concept.FourHorsemenOfThe2020s ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Minted tgs:Concept.FourHorsemenOfTheApocalypse (Revelation 6:1-8) as the canonical source of Nate's framework, and linked tgs:Concept.FourHorsemenOfThe2020s to it with thinkr:relatesTo. Chosen over renaming the 2020s concept, which would have conflated Nate's converging crises with the biblical riders."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGSBooksList_Import a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Work.TGSBooksList ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Imported the community list 'Books referenced in the Podcast' (tgs:Work.TGSBooksList) from the PDF MJSullivan printed of the page: 238 books after merging a duplicate and skipping one untitled entry. Minted 200 new tgs:Work individuals (title, year, ISBN-13 as dct:identifier urn:isbn where given, dct:creator where the author is already a tgs:Human, author names otherwise in rdfs:comment); matched 38 to existing Works and added 32 missing ISBNs to them. Added 238 dct:references links from the listed TGS episodes and Reality Roundtables, with back-links; skipped two that would cite a book published after the episode (The Anxious Generation, 2024, under TGS_59; The Story of CO2 Is the Story of Everything, 2025, under TGS_103). Episode assignments come from the list, not show notes, and are flagged as unconfirmed in each new Work's comment. Over-short IRIs were lengthened (e.g. tgs:Work.LimitsWhyMalthusWasWrong, tgs:Work.GaiaANewLookAtLifeOnEarth)."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.BioregioningEarthOntology_Added a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Work.BioregioningEarthOntology ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Added the Bioregioning Earth web taxonomy as tgs:Work.BioregioningEarthOntology at MJSullivan's request, with dct:relation links to the nine closest intervention subdomains, tgs:Concept.RightsOfNature, tgs:Concept.TwoWaysOfKnowing and tgs:Work.BioregionalFinancingFacilities, and a cluster-to-subdomain crosswalk in its scopeNote."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGS_227_Stub a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
