tgs:RevisionEvent.GameTheoryMechanisms_Added a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:ConceptScheme.GameTheoryMechanisms ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Added at MJSullivan's request as a neutral, third-party layer for crosswalking game-theoretic concepts by Nate Hagens, Daniel Schmachtenberger and others (gametheory.ttl): 3 branches and 18 terms, structured after Wikipedia's 'Game theory' article, each with skos:closeMatch to its Wikipedia article (all checked) and dcterms:source to Dixit, Skeath and McAdams' Games of Strategy or a primary source. New class thinkr:GameTheoryTerm; five source Works added. The GameTheoretic lens definition no longer calls it Daniel Schmachtenberger's lens alone. A Wikipedia article on the trust game does not exist (the URL redirects to the dictator game), so the trust game was left out. Mapping of TGS concepts to the scheme is a separate, later step."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.GameTheoryCrosswalk_Mapped a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:ConceptScheme.GameTheoryMechanisms ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Mapped TGS concepts to the game theory scheme at MJSullivan's request: 26 SKOS mappings (skos:closeMatch, skos:broadMatch, skos:relatedMatch), from a reviewed proposal in which each 'probable' row was checked against the graph's own episode text (3 promoted, 5 dropped) and 3 'possible' editorial rows were dropped. Two rows map Nate Hagens's Frankly_78 concepts to the stag hunt, on his statement that conforming to what others do is the biggest predictor of behavior. Four concepts that question classical game theory's assumptions (GameTheoryFillsTheOughtGap, GameTheoreticVersusRealValue, Wetware, ProsocialityUnderTheSuperorganism) get thinkr:contrastsWith tgs:Concept.GameTheory with Qualifies evidence. tgs:Concept.ThirdAttractor gets an editorial rdfs:seeAlso to the stag hunt, with a Candidate LinkNote marking it as interpretation. skos:narrower inverses added to the scheme."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.TGS_174_FullBuild a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
