tgs:RevisionEvent.ArchetypePracticeLinks a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Archetype.Disarmer, tgs:Archetype.Silvertongue, tgs:Archetype.Governess, tgs:Archetype.Alchemist, tgs:Archetype.Barber, tgs:Archetype.Effectivist, tgs:Archetype.Muse, tgs:Archetype.Wellspring, tgs:Archetype.Catalyst ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-21"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Linked the nine Fellowship archetypes (Frankly_58) to Bioregioning Earth practice terms and clusters at MJSullivan's request, for use in the WWNS series: 27 dcterms:relation links, each with a Candidate LinkNote and Evidence. From a reviewed proposal; MJSullivan kept every row, including those rated 'possible'. One link (Disarmer to Community Reconciliation) uses the broader sense of the Disarmer from WWNS #4 and carries Qualifies evidence marking it as an editorial extension. Disarmer to Political Advocacy also cites Frankly_159."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.WWNSArchetypeMatrix_Imported a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Work.WWNSArchetypeMatrix, thinkr:ArchetypeRole, thinkr:FitLevelType ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-21"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Brought MJSullivan's published WWNS archetype matrix into the graph at his request, approved from review sheet 6a: 255 thinkr:ArchetypeRole individuals (new file archetyperoles.ttl), one per rated cell, each with archetype, intervention subdomain, fit level (new enumeration thinkr:FitLevelType: Strong, Moderate, Light) and the one-line role as skos:definition. The 15 cells rated 'No clear role' are left out. 66 Strong fits also asserted as thinkr:hasStrongFitIn on the archetypes. New Work tgs:Work.WWNSArchetypeMatrix."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.Disarmer_PoliticalAdvocacy_Retracted a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Archetype.Disarmer ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-21"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.Correction ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Retracted tgs:Archetype.Disarmer dcterms:relation tgs:PracticeTerm.PoliticalAdvocacy, added earlier the same day (tgs:RevisionEvent.ArchetypePracticeLinks), with its LinkNote and two Evidence individuals, approved from review sheet 6c. Political Advocacy is a generic practice, so the link pointed any advocacy-related topic at the Disarmer, whose advocacy is about nuclear arms only. The Frankly_159 evidence was moved into the Disarmer's scopeNote."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.PracticeTermSubdomainGaps_Closed a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:ConceptScheme.BioregioningEarth ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-21"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Added 15 skos:relatedMatch links from eight Bioregioning Earth practice terms that had no direct link to any intervention subdomain (Political Advocacy, Clothing and Product Manufacturing, Materials Transformation, Coaches and Leaders, Theory U, Formal Scientific Process, Systems and Resource Mapping, Venture Cultivation), approved from review sheet 6e. Demonstrator Site deliberately gets none: a demonstrator can be about anything, and its initiatives reach their fronts through their topic terms."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.DevonDoughnut_Imported a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:ConceptScheme.DevonDoughnut, thinkr:DevonDoughnutDomain, tgs:Work.DevonDoughnutIndicatorCompilation ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-21"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Added the Devon Doughnut as its own scheme at MJSullivan's request (new file devondoughnut.ttl, new class thinkr:DevonDoughnutDomain), approved from review sheets 1 and 6b: 22 domains plus four grouping nodes, names and paraphrases only because the source is CC BY-NC-SA and marked not for reuse elsewhere. 42 skos:relatedMatch links from domains to intervention subdomains, so every domain reaches a front. The two halves closeMatch the existing tgs:DoughnutHalf individuals. New Work tgs:Work.DevonDoughnutIndicatorCompilation; linked to tgs:Initiative.DevonDoughnutProject. Crosswalks to the California categories (sheet 2) and to Bioregioning Earth practices (sheet 3) not yet built."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.DevonDoughnut_Crosswalks a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:ConceptScheme.DevonDoughnut, tgs:ConceptScheme.CaliforniaDoughnutIndicators, tgs:ConceptScheme.BioregioningEarth ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-21"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Crosswalked the Devon Doughnut at MJSullivan's request, approved from review sheets 2 and 3. Sheet 2: 28 links from Devon domains to California Doughnut categories (skos:closeMatch where the two measure the same thing, skos:relatedMatch where they share a system but measure different variables), matched on California's indicators rather than category names after MJSullivan queried five gap rows; only Access to Nature has no California counterpart. Sheet 3: 50 skos:relatedMatch links from Devon domains to Bioregioning Earth and One Earth practice terms, each drawn from Devon's own example pathways for action; two rows mapping to One Earth's textile-focused Recycle and Reuse were dropped in review. Review strength of every link is recorded in each domain's scopeNote."@en ;
    .

tgs:RevisionEvent.BaueR30_Additions a thinkr:RevisionEvent ;
    thinkr:affects tgs:Organization.R30, tgs:Human.BillBaue, tgs:Work.GiftOfTheTurtleIslandBioregionalCongress, tgs:Work.BioregionalCarryingCapacitiesPluriversalMRV, tgs:Concept.CollapseResponseContinuum, tgs:Concept.EliteOverproduction, tgs:Concept.CarryingCapacity ;
    thinkr:revisionDate "2026-10-21"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:revisionKind thinkr:RevisionKindType.InitialBuild ;
    thinkr:revisionNote "Added the r3.0 and Bill Baue material at MJSullivan's request, approved from review sheet 4: tgs:Organization.R30; Humans Bill Baue, Sherri Mitchell and Shalanda Baker (no Personas, none are TGS guests); Works for Baue's May 2026 deck, the r3.0 session series, his October 2026 TIBC11 post, Sacred Instructions, Anti-Resilience and Walker et al. (2004), the last two verified; a Source for the post (Unverified tier, a personal blog); tgs:Initiative.TurtleIslandBioregionalCongress11; six concepts (CarryingCapacity, PhantomCarryingCapacity, ContextBasedSustainability, CollapseResponseContinuum, CollapseResilience, EliteOverproduction), with thinkr:discusses from Frankly_68, Frankly_70, Frankly_82 and TGS_164 where Nate or the guest uses the idea; and four Candidate Evidence individuals from the post on existing archetype-to-practice LinkNotes. The Devon Doughnut scheme gets Baue's carrying-capacity framing. Concepts credited to Baue's work use thinkr:influencedBy tgs:Organization.R30, since thinkr:influencedBy cannot point at a Human."@en ;
    .

