    thinkr:revisionNote "Added thinkr:hasHostIntroduction (Nate's spoken introduction, from cleaned [INTRO] sections supplied by MJS) to Reality Roundtables 11 to 24, and thinkr:hasReplay (the YouTube link supplied with each) to all but RR_19, which already had it. Remaining auto-transcription slips corrected, chiefly names, aligned with the graph's own records: Gromen, Every, Gameau, CC (Clemence Currie), Joaquin, Wahl, Carlisle, Trasande, Muncke, Scheringer, Shanna Swan, Kaminska, Skye Cielita Flor, Arne Naess, Joshua Schrei, Meloy, Medish, McFarlane, Rabobank; titles (Thinking Like a Mountain, the Work That Reconnects, New START, Count Down, A Plastic Planet, Do the Math); and words such as curanderismo, pelagic drift netting, stalking violence and neurological disorders. Unverified and left as spoken: 'Groth' (the animated superorganism character in The Future Council, RR_13), 'Pantera' (Mark Medish's consultancy, RR_21) and 'Data Direct Technologies' (Craig Tindale's former employer, RR_22)."@en ;
